# Database dumps. Same reasoning as .env above: a pg_dump of this system
# carries real case records, user accounts and message history, and must
# never enter git history — including on a private branch, since history is
# not retroactively scrubbable once pushed.
*.dump
*.dump.gz
*.backup
env.bak/
venv.bak/

